{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-saint-of-management","title":"经营之圣","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-saint-of-management","wordCount":1367,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"综合评价\">综合评价</h1><p>本章在客观审视争议的基础上，对稻盛和夫做出全面的综合评价。一方面，充分肯定他作为&quot;经营之圣&quot;的非凡成就与深刻智慧；另一方面，也客观地正视围绕其经营哲学的争议。两篇文档，分别呈现&quot;经营之圣&quot;的崇高地位，以及一个全面而辩证的评判。</p>\n"}